WEBVTT

00:14.400 --> 00:14.960
Your Highness.

00:15.670 --> 00:16.960
Have you persuaded

00:16.960 --> 00:17.830
Prince Lie?

00:18.760 --> 00:19.280
Of course.

00:20.120 --> 00:22.480
A bold young man like Changying
is bound to lose his heart

00:22.640 --> 00:25.000
when he meets a woman as extraordinary

00:25.000 --> 00:26.320
as the Commandery Princess.

00:27.390 --> 00:29.830
I couldn't bear to see
someone born to be a great general

00:29.830 --> 00:30.912
trapped in the treacherous

00:30.960 --> 00:33.070
and calculated world
of the imperial capital.

00:35.430 --> 00:36.240
What about you?

00:36.430 --> 00:37.000
Me?

00:38.240 --> 00:39.750
Someone as frail and sickly as I am

00:40.110 --> 00:41.960
is better suited
for matters of the heart.

00:50.640 --> 00:51.790
Huayong.

00:51.960 --> 00:52.830
Changying?

00:53.150 --> 00:54.240
What are you doing here?

00:54.416 --> 00:55.840
I went to the East Palace earlier.

00:55.888 --> 00:58.020
The attendants said
you were in the Imperial Garden.

00:58.030 --> 00:59.150
So I came

00:59.350 --> 01:00.390
to thank you in person.

01:01.750 --> 01:02.560
We're brothers.

01:02.608 --> 01:04.016
There's no need for formalities.

01:04.310 --> 01:05.640
Your words

01:05.760 --> 01:07.040
were a true awakening for me.

01:07.600 --> 01:10.310
I've decided to ask for Commandery
Princess Zhaoning's hand in marriage.

01:10.320 --> 01:12.150
Between the Anlan Army
and the Northwest Army,

01:12.150 --> 01:13.120
I can only choose one.

01:15.408 --> 01:17.300
I'm willing to give up
command of the Anlan Army

01:17.640 --> 01:18.920
and serve under the Duke of Wei

01:19.310 --> 01:20.790
as one of the Northwest Army.

01:20.912 --> 01:22.896
This is my pledge
to the commandery princess.

01:22.944 --> 01:24.896
It will also fulfill my wish
to defend our homeland

01:24.944 --> 01:26.368
and fight on the battlefield.

01:27.640 --> 01:28.560
I...

01:32.920 --> 01:34.200
Is that

01:34.870 --> 01:36.230
what I meant?

01:37.680 --> 01:38.760
Rest assured, Huayong.

01:39.200 --> 01:40.950
I'll never tell Changqing
about your advice.

01:42.096 --> 01:43.510
At the hunting grounds that day,

01:43.840 --> 01:46.256
you also confessed your feelings
to the Commandery Princess.

01:47.000 --> 01:48.560
Yet you still put my happiness first.

01:49.280 --> 01:50.510
I truly admire

01:50.576 --> 01:52.176
your generosity and character.

01:52.560 --> 01:53.200
If one day

01:53.312 --> 01:54.920
I truly marry the Commandery Princess,

01:54.920 --> 01:55.790
the first person

01:56.350 --> 01:57.280
I'll thank will be you.

01:58.880 --> 01:59.936
I'll take my leave.

02:06.350 --> 02:06.920
Your Highness.

02:08.000 --> 02:09.800
So this is how you persuaded Prince Lie?

03:36.900 --> 03:37.696
=Blossoms of Power=

03:37.700 --> 03:40.544
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:40.580 --> 03:43.540
=Episode 8=

03:51.710 --> 03:52.630
How lovely.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.910
Come take a look.

03:56.150 --> 03:58.430
Mother, come have something delicious.

03:59.520 --> 04:00.910
It's the Double Ninth Festival.

04:00.910 --> 04:03.536
So many people have come to
Yunling Mountain to pray for blessings.

04:03.750 --> 04:04.590
Your Highness.

04:04.624 --> 04:05.632
I prepared five color cakes

04:05.632 --> 04:07.712
and chrysanthemum liquor
early this morning.

04:08.280 --> 04:10.240
Shall we find a place
to rest for a while?

04:10.360 --> 04:11.080
All right.

04:12.710 --> 04:13.360
Your Highness.

04:14.430 --> 04:15.840
The pavilion is full of young ladies.

04:16.016 --> 04:17.310
Please rest here for a while.

04:17.310 --> 04:18.680
I'll go buy you a kite.

04:24.000 --> 04:24.950
Young Lady,

04:24.950 --> 04:27.070
would you like a cornel bracelet?

04:27.160 --> 04:29.270
There's only one left.

04:35.240 --> 04:37.040
Thank you, Young Lady.

05:05.560 --> 05:06.480
Let's rest up ahead.

05:06.480 --> 05:06.950
All right.

05:07.430 --> 05:07.920
Let's go.

05:08.830 --> 05:11.070
Such a sight is rarely seen.

05:11.190 --> 05:11.720
Indeed.

05:20.630 --> 05:23.310
- A snake!
- There is a snake!

05:36.896 --> 05:38.920
What's happening
on the mountaintop ahead?

05:38.920 --> 05:39.720
Why is it so noisy?

05:39.830 --> 05:41.190
Quick. Let's go take a look.

05:41.390 --> 05:41.830
All right.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.630
Your Highness.

06:08.480 --> 06:10.120
Be careful not to get hurt.

06:11.136 --> 06:12.680
- Please forgive us, Your Highness.
- Please forgive us, Your Highness.

06:12.680 --> 06:14.800
- We failed to protect you.
- We failed to protect you.

06:14.870 --> 06:15.560
Get up.

06:15.800 --> 06:16.750
This isn't your fault.

06:17.800 --> 06:18.430
Your Highness!

06:19.390 --> 06:20.240
I have failed you.

06:20.304 --> 06:21.750
I should never have left your side.

06:21.750 --> 06:22.430
You too, get up.

06:23.472 --> 06:25.072
There's no need to blame yourself.

06:25.240 --> 06:26.920
They were after me all along.

06:27.870 --> 06:30.160
Who would use such a vicious method?

06:31.856 --> 06:33.584
We've already caught the culprit.

06:33.830 --> 06:34.360
Move.

06:35.000 --> 06:35.390
Let's go.

06:43.870 --> 06:46.480
Today, Tian Yuan and I came here
to pray for blessings.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.310
When it happened,

06:47.720 --> 06:49.040
we were halfway up the mountain.

06:50.390 --> 06:51.480
He must be the culprit.

06:51.870 --> 06:53.270
Why are you arresting me?

06:53.280 --> 06:54.750
You can't just seize people at random!

06:54.750 --> 06:55.830
Is there no justice left?

06:56.040 --> 06:57.240
The powerful are killing people!

06:57.310 --> 06:59.040
They treat human lives like nothing!

06:59.120 --> 07:01.560
Everyone rushed toward the pavilion

07:01.800 --> 07:02.800
to see what had happened.

07:03.120 --> 07:04.000
Then why were you

07:04.032 --> 07:05.380
the only one heading the other way?

07:05.390 --> 07:06.920
I had an urgent matter at home.

07:06.976 --> 07:08.800
Was I not allowed
to hurry down the mountain?

07:09.120 --> 07:11.190
You handled snakes
to keep from being bitten,

07:11.630 --> 07:13.160
so you covered your hands with realgar.

07:13.680 --> 07:15.040
Why would an ordinary hiker

07:15.270 --> 07:17.190
coat both hands with realgar?

07:18.040 --> 07:19.560
I've been bitten by snakes before.

07:19.680 --> 07:21.630
I use realgar to keep them away.

07:21.920 --> 07:23.160
What law have I broken?

07:26.750 --> 07:28.160
Little girl, come here.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.630
Tell me,

07:31.920 --> 07:33.270
who told you

07:33.480 --> 07:34.830
to sell me this cornel bracelet?

07:35.390 --> 07:36.360
It was him.

07:36.920 --> 07:38.560
You little brat!

07:38.750 --> 07:40.240
How can you make up such lies?

07:40.560 --> 07:41.630
You're talking nonsense!

07:43.310 --> 07:44.950
You sprinkled snake lure powder on it

07:45.430 --> 07:46.480
to attract venomous snakes.

07:47.040 --> 07:48.160
The cornel

07:48.192 --> 07:49.856
masked the scent
of the snake lure powder.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.632
The evidence and witnesses are all here.

07:51.808 --> 07:53.456
What else do you
have to say for yourself?

07:53.630 --> 07:54.000
I...

07:55.792 --> 07:57.070
Still not telling the truth?

07:57.600 --> 08:00.390
It was the second young lady
of Vice Minister Hu's family.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.950
I had no choice but to obey.

08:04.270 --> 08:05.480
(It's Hu Yingrao.)

08:11.950 --> 08:12.630
Tian Yuan.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.600
Hand this man over to Cui Jinbai.

08:14.750 --> 08:16.390
He'll take care of the rest.

08:16.800 --> 08:17.190
Yes.

08:20.270 --> 08:20.680
Let's go.

08:27.584 --> 08:28.830
It's rare to come up here.

08:29.510 --> 08:30.750
Don't let that wretched girl

08:30.848 --> 08:32.320
from the Hu family spoil your mood.

08:33.840 --> 08:35.360
Allow me to treat you to some tea.

08:35.670 --> 08:36.496
What do you say?

08:43.510 --> 08:45.550
Had Your Highness
not captured the culprit,

08:45.870 --> 08:47.000
he would've escaped by now.

08:47.840 --> 08:49.150
Thank you, Your Highness.

08:49.968 --> 08:51.456
There's no need for thanks.

08:51.790 --> 08:52.670
Your business

08:53.030 --> 08:53.910
is my business.

09:03.630 --> 09:04.630
How do you intend

09:05.030 --> 09:06.440
to deal with Hu Yingrao?

09:10.360 --> 09:11.670
Seat her

09:11.840 --> 09:13.390
where I was sitting in the pavilion.

09:14.150 --> 09:15.240
Release the venomous snakes.

09:15.960 --> 09:17.750
Whether she's bitten

09:18.030 --> 09:19.150
or falls off the cliff

09:19.480 --> 09:21.000
will depend on her own fate.

09:22.840 --> 09:25.630
You are as decisive as ever.

09:25.910 --> 09:26.960
Truly bold and heroic.

09:32.910 --> 09:35.120
Do you think Hu Yingrao targeted you

09:36.360 --> 09:37.960
simply because of your beauty?

09:41.664 --> 09:43.870
Hu Yingrao is a distant relative
of Noble Consort Rong.

09:43.904 --> 09:45.990
She has come and gone
from the palace since childhood.

09:46.440 --> 09:48.120
Noble Consort Rong dotes on her greatly.

09:48.272 --> 09:50.576
She has always hoped to unite
the families through marriage.

09:52.200 --> 09:53.510
She is the one Noble Consort Rong

09:53.840 --> 09:55.150
truly wanted to become

09:56.320 --> 09:57.360
Prince Lie's consort.

10:17.024 --> 10:18.096
Please enjoy your tea.

10:23.860 --> 10:26.340
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

10:26.360 --> 10:27.910
There's some skin balm in here.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.480
It's highly effective

10:29.630 --> 10:30.550
for cuts and bruises.

10:31.790 --> 10:33.630
My apologies, Prince Lie.

10:33.664 --> 10:35.310
The Commandery Princess
gave strict orders

10:35.320 --> 10:37.030
that nothing may be accepted.

10:37.120 --> 10:37.960
And...

10:38.750 --> 10:39.910
she won't see you either.

10:43.030 --> 10:44.030
She means

10:45.960 --> 10:47.750
to draw a clear line between us?

10:48.784 --> 10:51.360
The Commandery Princess
has never had feelings for you.

11:27.300 --> 11:32.300
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

11:55.080 --> 11:56.000
Your Highness.

11:56.000 --> 11:58.000
Prince Lie is still standing
outside the gate.

11:58.360 --> 12:00.390
At this rate,
he'll stand there all night.

12:00.448 --> 12:01.750
The rain is coming down so hard.

12:01.870 --> 12:03.270
Won't he get sick?

12:04.390 --> 12:05.440
Go tell him

12:05.632 --> 12:07.536
he's free to stand
in the rain wherever he likes.

12:08.080 --> 12:10.000
Just not in front
of Duke of Wei's Manor.

12:11.000 --> 12:12.150
Your Highness.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.440
Prince Lie is deeply devoted to you.

12:14.870 --> 12:16.030
Don't you think

12:16.390 --> 12:17.840
you're being too harsh?

12:18.120 --> 12:19.270
One moment you show concern,

12:19.328 --> 12:20.512
the next you soften your heart.

12:20.630 --> 12:22.440
How long can this back and forth go on?

12:23.720 --> 12:26.000
Indecision only brings more trouble.

12:28.790 --> 12:29.390
Yes.

12:34.320 --> 12:35.200
Your Highness.

12:35.390 --> 12:38.000
Will you still meet
the Crown Prince tomorrow?

12:38.600 --> 12:39.150
Yes.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.550
The Crown Prince is rather strange.

12:42.560 --> 12:44.790
Your Highness, your injuries
delayed you for several days.

12:44.870 --> 12:46.670
The Double Ninth Festival
has already ended.

12:46.752 --> 12:48.600
Why does he still
want you to go up the tower?

12:49.232 --> 12:51.510
I gave him my word
that I'd accompany him up the tower.

12:52.120 --> 12:53.360
I intend to keep it.

13:00.100 --> 13:02.460
(Favorable Weather
and Abundant Harvests)

13:02.870 --> 13:03.550
Your Highness.

13:04.120 --> 13:05.480
The Double Ninth Festival is over.

13:06.032 --> 13:07.720
The lantern market
has already been cleared.

13:08.670 --> 13:11.000
You invited me up here
to admire the lanterns.

13:11.120 --> 13:13.080
Which lanterns did you wish to show me?

13:37.670 --> 13:38.840
Do you like it,

13:40.270 --> 13:41.200
even just a little?

13:43.720 --> 13:44.910
Fireworks are beautiful,

13:45.480 --> 13:46.750
but they fade in an instant,

13:47.720 --> 13:48.840
leaving only lingering regret.

14:22.560 --> 14:25.210
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

14:25.790 --> 14:29.400
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

14:29.440 --> 14:30.256
Commandery Princess.

14:30.368 --> 14:32.000
Every lantern across the city tonight

14:32.032 --> 14:33.720
was specially made
at Crown Prince's command

14:33.792 --> 14:35.030
and delivered to every household.

14:35.792 --> 14:38.224
The palace invited eminent monks
to offer prayers and blessings.

14:38.288 --> 14:40.360
Any household that keeps
its lanterns lit until dawn

14:40.670 --> 14:41.960
will receive the monks' blessings.

14:42.750 --> 14:43.480
That's why

14:43.520 --> 14:45.000
the people have all joined in eagerly.

14:45.790 --> 14:47.030
It's even grander than

14:47.390 --> 14:48.870
the Double Ninth Lantern Festival.

14:49.770 --> 14:53.570
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

15:04.000 --> 15:05.080
I can feel

15:06.064 --> 15:07.696
the thought you put into all this.

15:10.600 --> 15:12.440
I simply took the opportunity

15:13.440 --> 15:14.440
to bring you

15:15.150 --> 15:16.120
a little joy.

15:24.030 --> 15:24.960
Thank you

15:25.024 --> 15:27.380
for letting me behold
the splendor of the imperial capital.

15:27.390 --> 15:28.440
The wind is strong up here.

15:28.640 --> 15:30.336
You shouldn't stay out
and catch a chill.

15:30.960 --> 15:32.150
We should head back.

15:35.910 --> 15:36.480
All right.

15:38.480 --> 15:39.504
I'll walk you back.

15:48.960 --> 15:49.510
By the way,

15:51.270 --> 15:52.200
how are your injuries?

15:54.880 --> 15:56.848
I had that ointment
prepared especially for you.

15:59.080 --> 16:00.600
Thank you for your kindness.

16:02.832 --> 16:04.736
With such
a beautiful display of lanterns,

16:05.150 --> 16:06.550
I'd like to stroll a little longer.

16:07.080 --> 16:07.550
All right.

16:25.392 --> 16:27.104
There's something I'd like to tell you.

16:29.504 --> 16:31.072
What happened with the Hu family

16:31.120 --> 16:32.352
was my fault for involving you.

16:34.440 --> 16:35.240
I came to apologize.

16:36.750 --> 16:37.790
It's already over.

16:38.240 --> 16:39.200
I'm unharmed.

16:39.216 --> 16:40.720
Please don't worry, Prince Lie.

16:45.600 --> 16:46.848
Commandery Princess.

16:48.576 --> 16:50.336
What is it about me
that isn't good enough?

16:50.400 --> 16:52.112
Everyone has their own preference.

16:52.440 --> 16:54.120
Just because you have feelings for me,

16:54.320 --> 16:55.720
does that mean I have to be grateful?

16:56.960 --> 16:58.120
That's not what I meant.

16:58.270 --> 16:59.600
I've told you before.

17:00.000 --> 17:01.600
Don't set your heart on me.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.750
I've already given my heart away!

17:09.070 --> 17:10.310
I can never take it back!

17:11.590 --> 17:13.790
That's just how life is.

17:13.856 --> 17:15.630
There will always be
things beyond our reach.

17:15.648 --> 17:16.896
I hope you will soon let go.

17:29.200 --> 17:29.830
Changqing.

17:33.310 --> 17:33.920
Changying.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.310
Let's go.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.830
A young lady like her

17:42.000 --> 17:43.240
can't be won over

17:44.510 --> 17:45.640
by persistence.

17:47.400 --> 17:48.070
But...

17:49.440 --> 17:50.590
The more you cling to her,

17:52.000 --> 17:53.440
the more determined she'll be

17:53.750 --> 17:54.750
to leave you.

18:08.240 --> 18:10.030
Have we come a little too far?

18:11.200 --> 18:12.880
Then please rest here for a moment.

18:13.030 --> 18:14.310
I'll go bring the carriage over.

18:14.400 --> 18:14.920
All right.

18:43.200 --> 18:43.920
Your Highness!

18:45.160 --> 18:45.790
Your Highness!

19:04.928 --> 19:07.030
Noble Consort Rong
may look kind, but she's ruthless.

19:07.110 --> 19:08.110
Her methods are vicious.

19:08.310 --> 19:09.440
Anyone who knows the truth

19:09.584 --> 19:11.312
would never want
to marry into that family

19:11.510 --> 19:12.830
and serve a mother-in-law like her.

19:14.790 --> 19:16.750
Still, both Changqing and Changying

19:17.070 --> 19:19.070
are unwaveringly devoted,

19:19.160 --> 19:20.110
each deeply in love.

19:22.200 --> 19:22.830
Your Highness.

19:22.840 --> 19:24.270
You must come up with a plan quickly.

19:24.440 --> 19:25.030
Otherwise,

19:25.104 --> 19:26.550
if you don't root out the problem,

19:26.920 --> 19:28.110
it will only return.

19:31.880 --> 19:33.000
How have we walked this far

19:33.240 --> 19:34.240
without seeing Zhaoning?

20:32.480 --> 20:33.110
Speak.

20:33.440 --> 20:34.400
Who sent you?

20:39.536 --> 20:41.968
Your Highness, he bit down
on poison and killed himself.

20:46.590 --> 20:47.240
Xihe.

20:50.352 --> 20:51.540
Tian Yuan, prepare the horses.

20:51.550 --> 20:51.960
Yes.

21:02.496 --> 21:04.580
The Commandery Princess's
pulse is extremely unstable.

21:04.590 --> 21:05.504
I've used acupuncture

21:05.568 --> 21:07.616
to temporarily stabilize
her heart meridian.

21:08.270 --> 21:09.830
But even if she wakes tomorrow,

21:10.144 --> 21:11.968
if she doesn't receive better treatment,

21:12.510 --> 21:15.880
I'm afraid she'll spend the rest
of her life confined to this sickbed.

21:28.070 --> 21:29.480
Just tell the Commandery Princess

21:31.030 --> 21:32.400
that she needs complete rest.

21:33.168 --> 21:34.768
Don't tell her anything else for now.

21:35.510 --> 21:36.000
Yes.

21:43.240 --> 21:44.030
Your Highness.

21:44.350 --> 21:45.270
I found

21:45.440 --> 21:46.790
traces of liquor in the body.

21:47.400 --> 21:48.880
The assassin drank Jieqianchou.

21:53.880 --> 21:55.310
Jieqianchou is an imperial liquor.

21:55.488 --> 21:56.960
It's only available in the palace.

21:57.024 --> 21:58.440
A fixed amount is issued every year,

21:58.750 --> 22:00.110
and every bottle is accounted for.

22:00.750 --> 22:01.880
We only need to find out

22:02.200 --> 22:04.240
who gave him the Jieqianchou,

22:04.550 --> 22:05.510
and we'll know

22:05.790 --> 22:06.720
who

22:07.440 --> 22:08.830
tried to harm Zhaoning.

22:09.830 --> 22:11.110
I'll investigate it at once.

22:14.880 --> 22:17.568
Still no word from Hua Fuhai
about the Extreme Frost Cordyceps?

22:17.920 --> 22:18.720
Only that medicine

22:18.816 --> 22:20.912
can stabilize
Commandery Princess's heart meridian.

22:20.960 --> 22:22.480
I've already sent people to inquire.

22:22.832 --> 22:24.176
It grows on the highest peaks

22:24.440 --> 22:25.590
of the frozen wilderness.

22:26.336 --> 22:28.480
The experts we've sent
have risked their lives,

22:29.024 --> 22:30.592
yet still haven't found it.

22:57.720 --> 22:58.480
Physician Xie.

22:59.590 --> 23:00.720
Why are her hands so cold?

23:21.590 --> 23:22.270
You're awake.

23:23.830 --> 23:25.030
It's you.

23:29.880 --> 23:30.310
Come.

23:33.872 --> 23:35.248
What do you mean, "it's you"?

23:36.240 --> 23:37.270
I thought

23:38.640 --> 23:40.000
the one who saved me

23:41.270 --> 23:42.110
was you.

23:52.790 --> 23:53.920
I wish it had been.

23:55.590 --> 23:56.680
But the one who saved you

23:57.400 --> 23:58.480
was my guard.

24:05.720 --> 24:06.750
Still, hearing you say that

24:07.310 --> 24:08.200
makes me very happy.

24:13.904 --> 24:14.920
Commandery Princess.

24:16.256 --> 24:18.704
I have urgent business
that requires me to leave the capital.

24:19.070 --> 24:20.160
Take good care of yourself.

24:20.510 --> 24:22.160
I'll come see you again in a few days.

24:26.790 --> 24:27.880
Take care.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.590
Do you know

24:46.440 --> 24:48.070
how much I wished you'd ask me

24:50.310 --> 24:51.440
where I was going

24:53.030 --> 24:54.070
and what I was going to do?

24:55.160 --> 24:56.590
I'm sure you have your reasons.

24:57.550 --> 24:58.720
There's no need for me to ask.

25:08.512 --> 25:09.536
Your Highness,

25:10.110 --> 25:11.440
are you truly going in person?

25:11.856 --> 25:14.000
The extreme cold will worsen
the poison inside your body.

25:14.070 --> 25:15.110
The danger will be immense.

25:28.920 --> 25:29.680
Zhaoning.

25:31.270 --> 25:32.830
How I wish that one day

25:34.750 --> 25:36.240
you would be reluctant

25:37.830 --> 25:38.920
to see me leave.

26:45.500 --> 26:48.400
♪Let it all go♪

26:48.400 --> 26:51.040
♪Give my tears to the flowers♪

26:52.650 --> 26:55.340
♪Beneath my feet, eternal doom♪

26:55.340 --> 26:58.410
♪Is more than wind and sand♪

26:59.640 --> 27:05.090
♪That perfectly plotted love
hides in the clamor♪

27:06.740 --> 27:12.110
♪Between us,
it's both treacherous and flawless♪

27:12.128 --> 27:13.168
Before Crown Prince left,

27:13.216 --> 27:14.480
he said that at this time of year,

27:14.480 --> 27:16.710
the foreign kingdoms
would present pomegranates as tribute.

27:16.720 --> 27:17.648
They're juicy and sweet.

27:17.690 --> 27:20.230
Their juice can be used to
make pastries for Commandery Princess.

27:20.240 --> 27:21.380
They're especially delicious.

27:21.904 --> 27:23.536
Please thank the Crown Prince for me.

27:23.640 --> 27:25.504
While Commandery Princess
recovers in bed,

27:25.552 --> 27:27.350
seeing these bright red pomegranates

27:27.480 --> 27:28.510
may lift her spirits.

27:28.880 --> 27:30.310
When will the Crown Prince return?

27:31.030 --> 27:32.720
♪My heart rises and falls♪

27:33.000 --> 27:34.000
There's no news yet.

27:34.560 --> 27:36.000
♪In this eternity♪

27:36.030 --> 27:37.968
Why did the Crown Prince
leave the capital?

27:38.960 --> 27:39.880
What was it for...

27:39.880 --> 27:40.992
I'm not quite sure either.

27:41.040 --> 27:43.072
If there's nothing else,
I'll take my leave.

27:43.210 --> 27:44.960
♪Sober, it's all like a dream♪

27:44.960 --> 27:48.510
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

27:48.510 --> 27:51.920
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

27:51.920 --> 27:55.440
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

28:14.080 --> 28:14.790
Your Highness...

28:15.510 --> 28:18.300
♪Spring brings life,
autumn brings death♪

28:19.880 --> 28:25.720
♪A heart weathered
by frost will melt in love♪

28:26.670 --> 28:28.620
♪Across countless miles
of treasured moments♪

28:28.620 --> 28:32.490
♪Every move is a game of truth and lies♪

28:35.024 --> 28:36.000
Commandery Princess...

28:36.460 --> 28:39.420
♪I'll become your armor♪

28:40.160 --> 28:41.184
I'll take my leave.

28:41.232 --> 28:46.370
♪I want destiny,
and also tender words of love♪

28:46.560 --> 28:54.190
♪As night stains my eyes,
I'll gaze once more at the rosy clouds♪

28:54.720 --> 28:58.180
♪I have a dream
of a long wind in my sleeves♪

28:58.180 --> 29:01.770
♪My heart rises and falls,
we embrace in a sea of clouds♪

29:01.770 --> 29:05.290
♪In this eternity, you are a part of it♪

29:05.290 --> 29:08.760
♪My longing can level mountains
and cross countless rivers♪

29:08.760 --> 29:12.260
♪Drunk or sober, it's all like a dream♪

29:12.260 --> 29:15.720
♪Stars sink into my hair,
the moon slips through my fingers♪

29:15.720 --> 29:19.160
♪For how much joy
do we share this life together♪

29:19.160 --> 29:22.520
♪Withering and flourishing,
year after year♪

29:57.350 --> 29:58.200
Your Highness!

29:58.750 --> 29:59.550
Your Highness!

29:59.920 --> 30:00.720
Your Highness!

30:09.072 --> 30:10.832
Deliver this
to the Commandery Princess...

30:11.310 --> 30:12.440
There must be no mistake...

30:13.160 --> 30:13.590
Yes.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.480
Hurry! Faster!

30:32.510 --> 30:33.270
Your Highness.

30:33.480 --> 30:35.440
This Extreme Frost Cordyceps
is incredibly rare.

30:35.680 --> 30:36.680
Just its fragrance alone

30:36.680 --> 30:38.000
is enough to refresh the spirit.

30:48.640 --> 30:50.720
It was sent again by Hua Fuhai?

30:52.030 --> 30:53.720
What is the Tagara Incense

30:54.510 --> 30:55.510
behind him really after?

30:56.400 --> 30:58.350
Your Highness,
this medicine is hard to come by.

30:59.070 --> 31:00.830
Your health must come first.

31:01.550 --> 31:02.030
Here.

31:09.328 --> 31:11.488
How is the investigation
into the assassin going?

31:12.350 --> 31:13.880
Following the Crown Prince's orders,

31:14.070 --> 31:16.000
I found the records on
where the Jieqianchou went.

31:16.550 --> 31:17.920
According to Physician Xie,

31:18.110 --> 31:19.550
the assassin didn't drink it that day.

31:19.550 --> 31:21.110
He drank it the day before,

31:21.240 --> 31:22.480
and at least 250 g.

31:22.640 --> 31:23.400
250 g?

31:27.088 --> 31:28.920
Drinking before carrying out
the assassination

31:28.920 --> 31:30.510
to steady his nerves is understandable.

31:31.750 --> 31:33.200
But 250 g...

31:33.210 --> 31:35.150
Wouldn't he be afraid
it would affect the mission?

31:35.160 --> 31:36.544
Based on the condition of the body,

31:36.544 --> 31:38.950
Physician Xie concluded the assassin
was likely from the south.

31:38.960 --> 31:40.440
I also asked Young Master Bu for help.

31:40.550 --> 31:43.296
But none of the southerners living in
or staying in the imperial capital

31:43.328 --> 31:44.170
are under suspicion.

31:44.270 --> 31:46.030
Drinking heavily
before the assassination,

31:46.480 --> 31:48.200
then taking poison
the moment he was exposed,

31:48.510 --> 31:50.110
shows he was prepared to die.

31:51.350 --> 31:52.920
Perhaps that flask of Jieqianchou

31:52.920 --> 31:53.960
was his reward.

31:54.310 --> 31:55.880
A final taste before dying.

31:56.790 --> 31:57.400
Mo Yu.

31:58.440 --> 31:59.510
Go find Young Master Bu,

32:00.070 --> 32:02.070
and ask him
to bring Vice Minister Cui here.

32:03.000 --> 32:03.480
Yes.

32:10.030 --> 32:10.680
Young Master.

32:10.680 --> 32:12.110
- What's wrong?
- Young Master.

32:12.110 --> 32:13.400
- You're ruining my plans.
- You really can't go in.

32:13.400 --> 32:14.200
The Lord isn't here.

32:14.200 --> 32:14.750
Jinbai.

32:15.350 --> 32:16.110
Feeling shy?

32:20.750 --> 32:21.510
Let him in.

32:25.312 --> 32:27.160
Vice Minister Cui
is upright and honorable,

32:27.160 --> 32:28.672
yet this playboy keeps pestering him

32:28.720 --> 32:30.160
and ruining his reputation everywhere.

32:30.240 --> 32:30.920
Outrageous.

32:31.400 --> 32:32.200
Speak.

32:38.110 --> 32:39.510
Can't I come

32:40.550 --> 32:42.000
to see you?

32:48.680 --> 32:50.590
A little flirting is harmless.

32:50.920 --> 32:52.110
But drawing a blade

32:53.590 --> 32:54.750
hurts our friendship.

33:05.960 --> 33:06.590
Wait.

33:14.880 --> 33:15.590
Shameless...

33:22.440 --> 33:23.110
Young Master.

33:23.110 --> 33:24.110
(The Greatest Form Is Formless)
You can't do this.

33:24.110 --> 33:25.720
- Where are you going?
- What's going on?

33:25.720 --> 33:26.416
Out of the way.

33:44.510 --> 33:45.472
Go get a wet cloth,

33:45.520 --> 33:47.480
and bring an incense sachet
to help revive him.

33:47.680 --> 33:48.160
Yes.

34:06.110 --> 34:06.790
You're awake?

34:07.440 --> 34:08.000
Want some?

34:08.320 --> 34:08.710
You...

34:08.960 --> 34:10.000
Mind yourself.

34:10.784 --> 34:12.544
Please don't take offense,
Your Highness.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.480
Your Highness.

34:17.792 --> 34:19.400
I was the one who invited you here.

34:19.880 --> 34:20.920
If I've been disrespectful,

34:21.230 --> 34:22.630
please forgive me.

34:24.640 --> 34:26.190
How may I assist you, Your Highness?

34:26.760 --> 34:27.520
I suspect someone

34:27.568 --> 34:29.320
was a death row inmate
who was switched out

34:29.320 --> 34:30.670
from the imperial prison.

34:31.360 --> 34:33.400
I'd like to ask you to investigate.

34:41.880 --> 34:44.190
Vice Minister Cui works remarkably fast.

34:46.110 --> 34:47.440
Aren't you on duty today?

34:47.840 --> 34:49.440
You neglect your duties all day long.

34:49.472 --> 34:51.536
Aren't you afraid
the Grand Censor will impeach you?

34:52.590 --> 34:53.590
Grand Censor Tao knows

34:53.590 --> 34:55.552
the Commandery Princess and I
are close friends.

34:55.560 --> 34:56.760
He'd never impeach me.

35:02.190 --> 35:02.800
Your Highness.

35:03.210 --> 35:04.260
I've thoroughly investigated

35:04.270 --> 35:06.170
every government office
in the imperial capital.

35:06.208 --> 35:07.808
I did find the man you were looking for.

35:08.110 --> 35:09.590
The condemned man was named Zhang Zhuo.

35:09.632 --> 35:10.840
The one who bought his life

35:11.070 --> 35:12.920
was a poor scholar named Fu Jin.

35:12.944 --> 35:14.208
He's from Xianning Commandery.

35:16.030 --> 35:17.280
A poor scholar?

35:18.360 --> 35:19.880
Why would he try to kill me?

35:22.070 --> 35:23.030
Was he

35:23.030 --> 35:24.760
close to any powerful officials?

35:25.590 --> 35:26.800
He kept to himself.

35:26.864 --> 35:27.792
His neighbors also said

35:27.800 --> 35:29.660
they never saw any wealthy
or influential people

35:29.670 --> 35:30.512
visiting his home.

35:32.630 --> 35:33.920
Xianning Commandery...

35:38.510 --> 35:39.630
If I remember correctly,

35:40.230 --> 35:41.590
the Bian family's ancestral home

35:41.800 --> 35:42.590
was Xianning.

35:43.280 --> 35:44.320
The Bian family?

35:44.510 --> 35:45.960
Isn't Bian Xianyi the only one left?

35:46.400 --> 35:47.670
She has a grudge against you?

35:49.150 --> 35:50.510
I'm only making a guess.

35:50.880 --> 35:52.230
An ancestral home alone

35:52.480 --> 35:53.280
proves nothing.

35:53.480 --> 35:54.840
Why waste time thinking about it?

35:54.840 --> 35:55.710
I'll have her arrested

35:55.808 --> 35:57.070
and beaten until she talks...

36:02.510 --> 36:03.360
Then

36:05.670 --> 36:07.030
arrest Fu Jin?

36:07.760 --> 36:09.360
I have plenty of ways

36:09.360 --> 36:11.670
to deal with
a delicate young scholar like him.

36:13.280 --> 36:14.000
Young Master Bu.

36:15.190 --> 36:16.320
This is the imperial capital.

36:16.592 --> 36:18.560
You may disregard propriety
and indulge yourself,

36:18.624 --> 36:21.376
but you must never behave so frivolously
before the Commandery Princess.

36:23.190 --> 36:24.190
Forget it.

36:25.440 --> 36:27.320
I'll watch my words from now on.

36:27.320 --> 36:28.320
I won't

36:28.400 --> 36:29.920
offend Your Highness's ears again.

36:42.550 --> 36:43.190
Your Highness.

36:43.232 --> 36:45.680
Fu Jin is a poor scholar
who has earned official qualifications.

36:45.760 --> 36:47.880
I hope Your Highness
can allow me a little more time.

36:47.952 --> 36:49.110
I'll investigate him in secret.

36:49.328 --> 36:50.976
No need to trouble a second person.

36:51.280 --> 36:52.280
My health is failing.

36:53.030 --> 36:54.440
With your help,

36:54.590 --> 36:55.480
I'd be most grateful.

36:57.670 --> 36:58.590
I take my leave.

37:16.440 --> 37:17.000
Your Highness.

37:17.392 --> 37:19.180
According to
Vice Minister Cui's investigation,

37:19.190 --> 37:21.536
Bian Xianyi was indeed
connected to the assassin, Fu Jin.

37:21.664 --> 37:23.110
The two were childhood sweethearts

37:23.110 --> 37:24.000
and grew up together.

37:24.176 --> 37:25.670
By the time our men went to arrest him,

37:25.670 --> 37:27.072
he was already dead at home.

37:28.710 --> 37:29.400
Your Highness.

37:29.510 --> 37:31.248
Bian Xianyi invites you
to have tea with her.

37:31.250 --> 37:33.168
She says she has something
important to tell you.

37:34.190 --> 37:35.550
I hadn't even gone looking for her,

37:36.070 --> 37:37.590
yet she came to me first.

37:51.070 --> 37:51.960
I...

37:52.110 --> 37:53.320
ask Your Highness's forgiveness.

37:56.480 --> 37:58.110
I trust Your Highness
has already guessed

37:58.440 --> 38:00.710
that I invited you because of Fu Jin's

38:00.840 --> 38:02.150
attempt to kill you.

38:03.000 --> 38:04.000
So you admit

38:04.550 --> 38:05.710
you knew Fu Jin?

38:07.880 --> 38:08.960
Fu Jin and I

38:10.030 --> 38:11.590
have known each other since childhood.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.480
The day my family was convicted,

38:15.190 --> 38:17.280
he promised
he would find a way to save me.

38:18.070 --> 38:19.510
So I counted the days,

38:19.568 --> 38:20.944
waiting for him for eight years.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.280
But as far as I know,

38:23.070 --> 38:24.150
all these years,

38:24.288 --> 38:26.760
you and the Sixth Prince
have been devoted to each other.

38:27.000 --> 38:28.880
I never had feelings
for the Sixth Prince.

38:30.000 --> 38:31.760
I claimed I refused
to become a concubine

38:31.960 --> 38:33.280
and kept stringing him along.

38:34.710 --> 38:37.150
At first, I was afraid of losing
my only source of protection.

38:37.880 --> 38:39.840
Later, I only hoped

38:40.880 --> 38:42.400
to see Fu Jin again one day.

38:45.000 --> 38:47.110
Your Highness must think I'm despicable

38:47.550 --> 38:48.800
and utterly shameless.

38:50.880 --> 38:52.070
I don't think that.

38:53.150 --> 38:54.590
You're stunningly beautiful,

38:55.000 --> 38:56.230
and only a dancer.

38:56.670 --> 38:58.550
Without the Sixth Prince's protection,

38:58.800 --> 39:00.736
how could you
have lived in peace until now?

39:03.776 --> 39:04.840
Thank you, Your Highness.

39:05.630 --> 39:07.000
But that's beside the point.

39:07.136 --> 39:09.920
You never should have
dragged me into this again and again.

39:12.440 --> 39:13.800
Did you want to kill me,

39:13.904 --> 39:15.824
or were you acting
under someone's orders?

39:17.760 --> 39:18.920
Forgive me,

39:21.000 --> 39:22.030
but I cannot say.

39:23.200 --> 39:25.216
Then you were acting
under someone's orders.

39:40.110 --> 39:41.280
Why did you take poison?

39:42.670 --> 39:43.320
She...

39:44.000 --> 39:45.150
She told me

39:46.360 --> 39:47.920
that if I poisoned Your Highness,

39:48.480 --> 39:50.550
she would let Fu Jin
and me leave together.

39:51.360 --> 39:52.510
But I know

39:52.760 --> 39:54.190
Fu Jin is already dead.

39:54.480 --> 39:55.840
Now I can go to him.

39:56.190 --> 39:57.510
No one can stop me.

39:59.440 --> 40:01.230
This is the only way

40:01.630 --> 40:03.400
I can protect my family.

40:03.840 --> 40:05.400
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

40:08.510 --> 40:09.230
Someone!

40:09.510 --> 40:10.280
Someone, quickly!

40:46.510 --> 40:47.360
Your Highness,

40:47.670 --> 40:49.710
this poison was refined
from poisonous mushrooms.

40:49.800 --> 40:53.110
It can destroy
all five vital organs in an instant.

40:58.320 --> 40:59.230
How could

41:00.510 --> 41:02.230
such a poison exist in the palace?

41:06.550 --> 41:07.760
Noble Consort Rong,

41:08.280 --> 41:10.440
Bian Xianyi invited me to tea.

41:11.280 --> 41:12.320
But unexpectedly,

41:12.400 --> 41:13.904
she took poison and killed herself.

41:14.440 --> 41:15.230
Your Highness,

41:15.590 --> 41:17.070
there was indeed poison

41:17.070 --> 41:17.960
in both teacups.

41:18.960 --> 41:20.320
Noble Consort Rong,

41:20.510 --> 41:22.400
Bian Xianyi brewed the tea herself.

41:22.400 --> 41:24.760
Many palace attendants
saw her in the tea room.

41:25.030 --> 41:27.190
She also said something strange today.

41:27.190 --> 41:28.304
She said that in the future,

41:28.320 --> 41:30.220
she might not be able
to have tea with us again.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.030
In that case,

41:34.030 --> 41:35.670
the truth is clear.

41:36.920 --> 41:39.550
I have also heard

41:39.880 --> 41:41.400
about Bian Xianyi and the Sixth Prince.

41:42.550 --> 41:43.960
Presumably, the Sixth Prince

41:44.016 --> 41:46.416
intended to ask for
Commandery Princess's hand in public.

41:47.000 --> 41:48.710
Driven by jealousy,

41:48.784 --> 41:50.208
Bian Xianyi made a grave mistake

41:51.110 --> 41:52.590
and took her own life out of guilt.

41:53.440 --> 41:54.510
In that case,

41:55.280 --> 41:56.550
have her body

41:57.280 --> 41:58.630
removed according

41:59.360 --> 42:00.440
to palace rules.

42:02.440 --> 42:03.110
- Yes.
- Yes.

42:07.150 --> 42:08.360
Your Highness

42:08.550 --> 42:10.230
must have been frightened today.

42:11.320 --> 42:12.710
Why not come to my palace

42:13.630 --> 42:14.920
for some calming tea?

42:15.440 --> 42:16.710
Thank you, Noble Consort Rong.

42:17.230 --> 42:19.030
I'm rather tired.

42:19.104 --> 42:20.480
I would like to return and rest.

42:22.070 --> 42:22.880
Very well.

42:24.030 --> 42:26.190
I will not insist.

42:27.070 --> 42:27.710
You may go.

42:49.920 --> 42:51.360
(There are many suspicious details.)

42:52.230 --> 42:53.710
(Who is behind all this?)

42:54.960 --> 42:55.920
(Right now,)

42:56.360 --> 42:57.960
(I have no one to discuss this with.)

43:38.180 --> 43:41.940
(East Palace)

43:47.380 --> 43:51.180
(East Palace)

44:08.190 --> 44:09.360
This marriage

44:09.584 --> 44:10.840
has nothing to do with love.

44:11.040 --> 44:12.320
Someone with little time left

44:12.590 --> 44:14.030
and no ability to fight back

44:14.360 --> 44:15.510
is exactly what I need.

44:15.920 --> 44:18.304
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
grew up in the northwest.

44:18.304 --> 44:20.550
Every lady from the northwest
knows how to ride.

44:20.550 --> 44:21.480
Today,

44:21.480 --> 44:22.840
let us see for ourselves.

44:22.890 --> 44:24.920
Commandery Princess
fell from her horse into a ravine

44:24.930 --> 44:25.936
and remains missing.

44:30.710 --> 44:33.650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

44:34.270 --> 44:37.070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

44:37.940 --> 44:44.910
♪So never uncover♪

44:45.100 --> 44:47.460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

44:48.590 --> 44:51.320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

44:52.280 --> 44:57.620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

44:59.380 --> 45:02.200
♪Every answer I gave♪

45:03.000 --> 45:05.850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

45:06.640 --> 45:10.010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

45:10.270 --> 45:13.580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

45:16.550 --> 45:19.990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

45:20.980 --> 45:23.310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

45:24.580 --> 45:30.340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

45:31.750 --> 45:34.880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

45:35.330 --> 45:38.340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

45:38.450 --> 45:45.090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

45:45.090 --> 45:48.760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

45:49.630 --> 45:52.390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

45:52.830 --> 45:55.960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

45:56.400 --> 46:02.350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

46:03.750 --> 46:07.300
♪You'll never♪

46:07.580 --> 46:17.050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

46:43.220 --> 46:46.700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
